flowchart TD
    Start([Supervisor 루프 시작]) --> SetConnecting[state = Connecting]
    SetConnecting --> Connect[establish_session 시도]
    Connect -->|실패| SetDisconnected[state = Disconnected]
    SetDisconnected --> CheckFirstFail{첫 연결인가?}
    CheckFirstFail -- Yes --> ReturnErr[register 에 Err 전파]
    CheckFirstFail -- No --> WaitBackoff[wait_with_shutdown backoff<br/>* shutdown 수신 시 종료]
    ReturnErr --> WaitBackoff
    WaitBackoff --> CalcBackoff[backoff = min backoff * 2, 30s]
    CalcBackoff --> SetConnecting
    
    Connect -->|성공| SetConnected[state = Connected<br/>backoff = 1s 리셋]
    SetConnected --> CheckFirstSuccess{첫 연결인가?}
    CheckFirstSuccess -- Yes --> ReturnOk[register 에 Ok 전파]
    CheckFirstSuccess -- No --> SpawnReader[spawn reader_loop<br/>event_rx -> WorkerEvent broadcast]
    ReturnOk --> SpawnReader
    SpawnReader --> Select{tokio::select!}
    Select -->|cmd_rx 수신 Shutdown| Exit([루프 탈출 & 종료])
    Select -->|reader_handle 종료 ReaderExited| ClearActive[fail_active_task 실행]
    ClearActive --> SetConnecting
